- # Model Router
- > Intelligent AI model selection router for ClawHub agents.
- Automatically switches between two configured AI models based on task complexity, privacy requirements, and your preferences.
- ## Features
- - **Two-Model Architecture** - Configure a primary (simple tasks) and secondary (complex tasks) model
- - **Automatic Detection** - Scans your computer for local models (Ollama, LM Studio, llama-cpp-server)
- - **Cloud Model Support** - Built-in support for Claude, GPT, Gemini, Together AI, Groq
- - **Privacy-First** - Automatically detects sensitive data and routes to local model
- - **Easy Configuration** - Interactive setup wizard with guided prompts
- - **No Dependencies** - Works with Python standard library
- - **API Key Management** - Secure storage or environment variables
