- # Model Router
- An intelligent model selection router that automatically chooses between two configured AI models based on task complexity, privacy requirements, and your preferences.
- ## Overview
- Model Router lets you configure **two AI models** and automatically routes requests to the most appropriate one:
- - **Primary Model** → For simple tasks (fast, typically local)
- - **Secondary Model** → For complex tasks (capable, typically cloud)
