- ### Context Strategies
- | Strategy | Description | Use Case |
- |----------|-------------|----------|
- | `full` | Pass all message history | Short conversations |
- | `recent` | Pass only recent N messages | Long conversations |
- | `summary` | Summarize previous context | Token savings |
- | `decision` | Pass only decision metadata | Minimal overhead |
- ### Configuration Options
- | Option | Default | Description |
- |--------|---------|-------------|
- | `enabled` | `true` | Enable context tracking |
- | `max_messages` | `10` | Maximum messages to include |
- | `max_tokens` | `8000` | Maximum tokens for context |
- | `strategy` | `"full"` | Context inclusion strategy |
